{
  "version": 1,
  "_comment": "Shared research in the Academy: the group researches together, one tech at a time, and every finished tech's effects reach every member's villages. A member starts a tech from a village with an Academy of `academyLevel` once the group knows every tech in `requires` (and has found its lore scroll, `requiresScroll`): it costs `researchPerSecond` research for every second it lasts, taken from what the members' Academies have brought in (the group's pool, from the members in turn). Its `cost` in resources is then gathered from the members: any of them sends from any village what they can of what it still needs; once it is all paid the research begins and lasts `seconds` game seconds (divided by world speed). Effects add up across the group's techs: production.<resource>/production.all, outpostYield, storage (+share of capacity), buildTime/trainTime (negative = faster), upkeep (negative = less grain), attack.<family>/attack.all, defense.<family>/defense.all, homeDefense (defenders in their own village), lootTaken (negative = raiders take less), caravanSpeed, caravanCapacity, scoutSpeed, scoutSurvival (added to the survival chance).",
  "researchPerSecond": 0.1,
  "branches": {
    "economy": "Economy",
    "military": "Military",
    "fortification": "Fortification",
    "scouting": "Scouting",
    "faith": "Faith"
  },
